TOTK: the memory pool table for global memory at loaded addresses has 8192 entries (GmemMapLog2 13), the size
runtime/vk_exec_draw.c GMEM_ENTRIES builds. With 4096, OoT's forest map had 4,136 to 4,142 pools: the host
left the smallest imported ones out, and loads and stores through them went nowhere (the pause menu's tab label and
button glyphs came out garbled; with 8192 they are right). The binary search takes one more step; the 2 MiB hint is
still tried below 2^40, where the game's pools and its device pool at 0x8000000000 lie.

--- a/src/Ryujinx.Graphics.Shader/Translation/Optimizations/GlobalToStorage.cs
